  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_042b713e-a3d3-4661-8b71-4fb868c61220.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<h2>Essence Mod</h2>\n<p>在自訂結構中，與新的 Epic Fight 生物展開史詩般的戰鬥。</p>\n<p>這些生物專為遊戲中期至後期設計。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>新增生物</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1552063/description_fc528c44-ade5-4a6b-bc99-6e6a13209dd0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"707\"></p>\n<h3>[啟明者]</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>一位手持下界合金戰杖、機動性極高的 Boss。</li>\n<li>你可以從他身上獲得下界合金戰杖。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>使用「啟明之召」即可在啟明沼澤中找到啟明者。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>[「啟明之召」合成配方]</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cbdb9076-a89c-4ebd-b1db-87572d6bf35d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"499\" height=\"206\"></p>\n<p>右鍵點擊使用。它能協助你定位「啟明沼澤」。</p>\n<p>此物品也可用於召喚「啟明者」。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em>（當你靠近特定方塊、手持此物品並注視它時右鍵點擊……可能會發生一些神秘的事情……）</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>[啟明沼澤]</h3>\n<p>「充滿啟明之力的沼澤」</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1552063/description_21d34c00-ebc2-4f46-b9f4-8a6b9b4e5dfe.png\"></p>\n<p>此結構在沼澤生物群系中生成機率較低（通常距離出生點 1,000 至 8,000 格遠）。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>未來更新將加入更多生物。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>相依模組</h1>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2><strong>- 必要</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>（最新版本）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-weapons-of-miracles-expansion-wom-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight: Weapons of Miracles Expansion (wom plus)</a>（最新版本）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-nightfall/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight-Nightfall</a>（最新版本）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-dawn-day/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight: Dawn Day</a>（最新版本）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-extra/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight-Extra</a>（最新版本）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relda-mod/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reldas Medieval Armor</a>（最新版本）</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-extra/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles - epic fight</a>（最新版本）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-evolution/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combat Evolution</a>（最新版本）</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2><strong>- 選用</strong></h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/p1nero-better-structure-block/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">P1nero's Better Structure Block</a>（最新版本）</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>音樂鳴謝</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<h4><strong>Brave Soul [史詩交響戰鬥音樂]</strong></h4>\n</div>\n<div>作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony\" rel=\"nofollow\">Makai Symphony</a><br>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony%252fbrave-soul-epic-battle-music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundcloud.com/makai-symphony/brave-soul-epic-battle-music</a></p>\n<div>\n<h4><strong>Duel [史詩交響戰鬥音樂]</strong></h4>\n</div>\n<div>作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony\" rel=\"nofollow\">Makai Symphony</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony%252fduel-epic-orchestral-battle-music-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundcloud.com/makai-symphony/duel-epic-orchestral-battle-music-1</a></div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>Infinity Power [史詩交響戰鬥音樂]</strong></h4>\n<div>作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony\" rel=\"nofollow\">Makai Symphony</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fmakai-symphony%252finfinity-power-epic-orchestral-battle-music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundcloud.com/makai-symphony/infinity-power-epic-orchestral-battle-music</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h2><strong>補充說明</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>這是我的第一個模組，部分程式碼是在 AI 的協助下開發的。如果你發現任何錯誤，歡迎隨時留言！</p>\n</div>",
